  "ruleText": "Ph 307.02 Renewal Application Where Obtained and Filed. Applications for the renewal of a permit to operate a pharmacy in New Hampshire may be obtained from, and shall be filed at the board office.\n\nSource. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10702, INTERIM, eff 10-23-14, EXPIRED: 4-21-15\n\nNew. #11031, eff 1-29-16",
